ibe</Button>\n\t\t</form>\n\n\t\t<p class=\"text-muted-foreground text-center text-xs\">\n\t\t\tBy subscribing you agree to our\n\t\t\t<a class=\"underline hover:no-underline\" href=\"#title\">Privacy Policy</a>.\n\t\t</p>\n\t</Dialog.Content>\n</Dialog.Root>\n",
